  "title": "Kourovka Notebook Problem 21.9",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $F$ be a non-abelian free pro-$p$ group of finite rank. Can one find a finite collection $U_1,\\ldots,U_n$ of open subgroups of $F$, including $F$ itself, such that the only subgroup of $F$ which is contained in $U_i$ and is characteristic in $U_i$ for every $i$ is the trivial subgroup?",
